	"Author": "MGChaser",
	"Description": "This mod adds an FMG experience to Stardew Valley! \n<br />\n<br />*Bachelorettes receive new muscle sprites, portraits, dialog, scenes, and animations. (If you marry your spouse before year 2, they will grow!) [This is currently only available for Penny, Abigail and Haley, though more are in the works]\n<br />\n<br />*Some non-marriageable characters such as Sandy and Robin receive new dialog, sprites and portraits.\n<br />\n<br />*Extra dialog for other NPCs \n<br />\n<br />///NEW///\n<br />\n<br />*Marry your spouse before year 2, and you will unlock a special growth scene on the final day of the year! \n<br />\n<br />//REQUIRED\n<br />\n<br />This mod will require you to download the latest version of:\n<br />\n<br />- SMAPI -\n<br />https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2400\n<br />\n<br />- Content Patcher -\n<br />https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915 \n<br />\n<br />To install, find your stardew valley folder (browse local files via steam for easy access.) Then simply place this entire (unzipped) folder into the mods folder.\n<br />(along with SMAPI and content patcher.)\n<br />\n<br />//OPTIONAL\n<br />\n<br />This Mod is compatible with the multiple spouses, and custom patio's mod. (you will need both for either to work.)\n<br />Which will allow you to romance, and marry all of the muscle girls you desire!\n<br />\n<br />https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6227",
